        skos:altLabel          "Core Config 119";
        skos:definition        "Threshold for the valve action durations. The valve flow is known for each float and CONFIG_OilVolumeMaxPerValveAction_cm^3 is converted to a maxDurationOfValveAction. During descent phases the float regularly computes a valve duration to sink to the target depth. In some specific cases the result can be a huge valve action duration and the result must be thresholded by maxDurationOfValveAction. Template_Values:{unit:[cm^3]}."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:R18::CC00119";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "CONFIG_OilVolumeMaxPerValveAction_cm^3"@en .

