        dc:description          "List of float configuration settings selected by the float Principal Investigator (PI). Configuration parameters selected for a float are stored in the float 'meta.nc' file, under CONFIG_PARAMETER_NAME and LAUNCH_CONFIG_PARAMETER_NAME, which are populated by R18 prefLabel. Detailed information (incl. Template_Values explanation) is in the user manual (https://dx.doi.org/10.13155/29825), in the Reference Table 18 section.";
